      "text": "**Crown wheel geometry:** The crown wheel has teeth that project axially (perpendicular to the wheel face), like the battlements on a castle crown — hence the name. Typically 13 or 15 teeth (odd numbers to prevent pallets engaging on opposite sides simultaneously)."
    },
    {
