        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Watchmaking - 02 The Verge Escapement",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Verge (spindle):** A vertical shaft with two flat paddles (pallets) set approximately 90–120° apart along its length. The critical angular offset: both pallets must engage the crown wheel teeth, but on opposite sides (one on the front face of the crown wheel, one on the back)."
