      "text": "```\nOSCILLATOR TYPE           EIGENVALUES           STABILITY\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nFoliot (no restoring       λ = 0 (pole at        Marginally stable: no\n  force, inertia only)     origin)               natural frequency. Rate is\n                                                 entirely determined by\n                                                 driving force. Open-loop."
